  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Promocin de la Economa Forestal en Apoyo a la Lucha Contra la Deforestacin</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promotion of the Forest Economy in Support of the Fight Against Deforestation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Consolidar la economa forestal para el uso sostenible del bosque y la biodiversidad, y realizar intervenciones integrales en reas ambientales estratgicas que beneficien a la poblacin vulnerable que las habitan, entre otras cosas, mediante el desarrollo de productos y servicios basados la conservacin y el uso sostenible.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promote the forest economy as an alternative for the sustainable use and conservation of forests, seeking also to provide opportunities to vulnerable communities located in protected areas, with conservation and sustainable projects.</narrative>
  </description>
